{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfPysVdZcPfZqtnTi9hbw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! All tests pass. Let me create a concise summary of what was implemented:\n\n## Summary of Changes\n\nI've successfully implemented the three features specified in BE-005:\n\n### 1. **Partial Fulfilment**\n- Added `quantity` field to Order and Shipment (default 1, validated > 0)\n- Added `DELIVERED` status to ShipmentStatus enum\n- Created Fulfilment data class tracking allocated, delivered, and status\n- Implemented shipment transitions: CREATED→CONFIRMED, CONFIRMED→DELIVERED, CREATED→CANCELLED\n- Added allocation checking: POST /shipments rejects with 409 if exceeding order quantity\n- Added fulfilment status filter: GET /orders?fulfilment=STATUS\n- Added quantity amendment: PUT /orders/{orderId}/quantity (validates no reduction below allocated)\n- Cancelled shipments release their quantity (status != CANCELLED in allocation checks)\n\n### 2. **Customer Validation**\n- Added CUSTOMER_NOT_FOUND error code with 422 UnprocessableEntityException\n- POST /orders now rejects non-existent customers with 422 through error envelope\n- GET /customers/{customerId} now returns 404 with error envelope\n- Updated OrderControllerTest to create customers before creating orders\n\n### 3. **Paged Lists**\n- Added limit (1-100, default 100) and offset (0+, default 0) to all list endpoints\n- Added X-Total-Count header with total count (after fulfilment filter for orders)\n- Validation: returns 400 for invalid limit/offset\n- All lists sorted by id (orderId, shipmentId, customerId)\n\n### Key Implementation Details\n- Fulfilment status is calculated on-the-fly from current shipments\n- Shipments contribute to \"allocated\" when not CANCELLED\n- Shipments contribute to \"delivered\" when DELIVERED\n- Status transitions are enforced (409 for invalid transitions)\n- Existing tests updated to reflect new requirements\n\n**All 13 tests pass successfully** ✅"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2531,"cache_read_input_tokens":56947,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2531},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cf1c0966-8d3d-468c-aed5-d801e861e652","uuid":"d43c46f2-a09e-4f82-ac9b-bfac35e1e9ed","timestamp":"2026-09-25T10:14:32.619Z","request_id":"req_011CfPysVBmKzvNuGTWLpZtz"}
